2026-11-11T17:41:06.835+00:00 | $ soup export --help
2026-11-11T17:41:07.762+00:00 |  Usage: soup export [OPTIONS]                                                                                                                                                                           
2026-11-11T17:41:07.763+00:00 |  Export a model to GGUF, ONNX, TensorRT-LLM, BitNet, or TorchAO format.                                                                                                                                 
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | ╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | │ *  --model              -m      <str>  Path to model directory (full model or LoRA adapter) [required]                                                                                               │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | │    --format             -f      <str>  Export format: gguf, onnx, tensorrt, bitnet, tq1_0, torchao, gguf-ud (torchao needs --quant-config) [default: gguf]                                           │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | │    --quant              -q      <str>  Quantization type: q4_0, q4_k_m, q5_k_m, q8_0, f16, f32 [default: q4_k_m]                                                                                     │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | │    --output             -o      <str>  Output file path. Default: <model-name>.<quant>.gguf                                                                                                          │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | │    --base               -b      <str>  Base model ID (for LoRA adapters). Auto-detected if not set.                                                                                                  │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | │    --llama-cpp                  <str>  Path to llama.cpp directory. Auto-detected or cloned to ~/.soup/llama.cpp                                                                                     │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | │    --onnx-task                  <str>  ONNX export task: text-generation (causal LM) or feature-extraction (embedding) [default: text-generation]                                                    │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | │    --deploy                     <str>  Auto-deploy after export. Currently supported: ollama                                                                                                         │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.794+00:00 | │    --deploy-name                <str>  Model name for deployment (used with --deploy)                                                                                                                │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.795+00:00 | │    --calibration-data           <str>  Path to calibration JSONL for imatrix GGUF export.                                                                                                            │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.795+00:00 | │    --registry-id                <str>  Attach exported artifact to this registry entry (default: auto-match by source --model output dir)                                                            │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.795+00:00 | │    --trust-remote-code                 Allow loading models that ship custom Python via auto_map. Default deny (v0.36.0). Only enable if you trust the source.                                       │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.795+00:00 | │    --quant-config               <str>  Path to YAML for torchao PTQ export (v0.53.1 #142). Required when --format=torchao.                                                                           │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.795+00:00 | │    --gguf-flavour               <str>  Advanced GGUF format flag — UD-Q*_K_XL / IQ*_M / Q4_0_4_4 / etc. Required when --format=gguf-ud (v0.53.1 #139).                                               │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.795+00:00 | │    --hub                        <str>  Source hub for the base model when --model is a LoRA adapter: hf (default) / modelscope / modelers (v0.53.10 #152). [default: hf]                             │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.795+00:00 | │    --verbose                           Stream GGUF converter and quantizer logs while they run.                                                                                                      │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.795+00:00 | │    --no-install-deps                   GGUF only: never invoke pip; refuse missing conversion dependencies before work.                                                                              │
2026-11-11T17:41:07.795+00:00 | │    --help                              Show this message and exit.                                                                                                                                   │
